# Selectable Grid List — a 4-column FlatList of 50 photos with tap-to-toggle and drag-to-select ranges (pan computes the cell under the finger, auto-scrolls near the top), a check badge per cell and a floating "x N" counter (ReText) that resets the selection.
# What this test covers: toggling one cell on/off/on, a horizontal range drag, a diagonal multi-row range drag,
# re-dragging over an already selected range, the reset button (counter springs away), scrolling to the end of
# the list and selecting there, a slow drag in the top row that auto-scrolls the list up while the range grows,
# and a final reset.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/selectable-grid-list"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 40000
wait 2500
# Toggle the first cell on, off, on.
press 50 168
wait 500
press 50 168
wait 500
press 50 168
wait 600
# Range drag across the second row.
gesture pan 150 270 200 0 900
wait 700
# Diagonal range across three rows (rows 3-4).
gesture pan 60 370 250 150 900
wait 700
# Re-drag over the already selected second row (pending set filters the current one).
gesture pan 350 270 -300 0 900
wait 700
# Reset with the floating counter button.
press 334 822
wait 900
# Fast swipes scroll the list to its end.
swipe 200 750 200 150
wait 1200
swipe 200 750 200 150
wait 1500
# Select in the last rows.
press 150 780
wait 500
gesture pan 60 680 280 0 900
wait 700
# Slow drag along the top row: auto-scrolls the list up while the range keeps growing.
gesture pan 60 190 280 0 3000
wait 1500
# Reset everything.
press 334 822
wait 1000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 20000
press "label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
